      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "59AB8202A7EA8494",
      "text": "Au risque de me répéter, moi, c’est Clove.\\nTon vieux pote. Tâche de t’en souvenir.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "59AB8302A7EA8647",
      "text": "Eh oui, c’est moi, ton vieux pote Clove.\\nToi-même tu le sais.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "59AB8002A7EA812E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\nAvant tout, je dois te dire merci.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "59AB8102A7EA82E1",
      "text": "Car c’est grâce à toi que j’ai été accepté\\nau sein de l’Opération Stardust.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0040_select_03",
      "hash64": "8DFCA97950E4C03E",
      "text": "Pourquoi avoir rejoint l’opération ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0040_select_04",
      "hash64": "8DFCAC7950E4C557",
      "text": "Quel est le but de tout ça ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "59AB7E02A7EA7DC8",
      "text": "Je veux comprendre ce qui se passe avec la Team\\nStar, et pourquoi ses membres agissent ainsi...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0040_select_05",
      "hash64": "8DFCAB7950E4C3A4",
      "text": "C’est-à-dire ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0040_select_06",
      "hash64": "8DFCAE7950E4C8BD",
      "text": "Que se passe-t-il ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "59AB7F02A7EA7F7B",
      "text": "Des rumeurs courent sur eux...\\c\\nOn dit qu’ils harcèlent les élèves. Ils en auraient\\npoussé un grand nombre à quitter l’école...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "59AB7C02A7EA7A62",
      "text": "Il paraît aussi qu’ils montent un plan pour prendre\\nd’assaut l’académie depuis leurs repaires...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "59AB7D02A7EA7C15",
      "text": "Mais ce ne sont que des rumeurs.\\nIl y a plus préoccupant...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "59AEEA02A7ED6B23",
      "text": "Les membres de cette Team Star sèchent\\nl’école depuis bien trop longtemps...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "59AEE902A7ED6970",
      "text": "En particulier les cinq élèves qu’ils appellent\\n« boss ».\\c\\nCela fait plus d’un an qu’ils n’ont pas mis\\nles pieds à l’école.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "59AEEC02A7ED6E89",
      "text": "En outre, leurs sbires ont récemment commencé\\nà commettre des actes de délinquance.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "59AEEB02A7ED6CD6",
      "text": "Vous comprenez que je trouve cela inadmissible.\\nC’est pourquoi je leur ai lancé un ultimatum.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "59AEEE02A7ED71EF",
      "text": "Je les ai sommés de dissoudre leur organisation,\\nsans quoi je renverrai tous les élèves qui leur\\r\\nsont affiliés.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "59AEED02A7ED703C",
      "text": "Mais ils ont ignoré ma demande, et l’échéance\\nde mon ultimatum approche à grands pas...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "59AEF002A7ED7555",
      "text": "C’est à ce moment que j’ai entendu votre\\nconversation avec Cassiopée.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
